## Investigation Report: Deep Linking in `glasses_app`

---

### 1. Global GoRouter / out-of-tree navigation

**Yes — a single global router exists**, defined in `apps/glasses_app/lib/app_router.dart`:

```32:33:apps/glasses_app/lib/app_router.dart
/// Root navigator key for app-level navigation from providers.
final rootNavigatorKey = GlobalKey<NavigatorState>();
```

```88:101:apps/glasses_app/lib/app_router.dart
final appRouter = GoRouter(
  navigatorKey: rootNavigatorKey,
  observers: [_RouteLoggingObserver()],
  redirect: (context, state) {
    // ... route logging + error reporter update ...
    return null;
  },
  routes: _buildRoutes(),
);
```

**Out-of-tree navigation pattern:** `rootNavigatorKey.currentContext` is used in `app.dart` when there is no widget `BuildContext`:

```144:150:apps/glasses_app/lib/app.dart
