### 3. `pushAuthRequired` call sites

**Definition** (`packages/feature/account/feature_account_auth/lib/src/routing/auth_route_helper.dart`):

```9:15:packages/feature/account/feature_account_auth/lib/src/routing/auth_route_helper.dart
void pushAuthRequired(BuildContext context, WidgetRef ref, String path) {
  if (ref.read(authSessionReaderProvider)()?.isAuthenticated ?? false) {
    context.push(path);
    return;
  }
  context.push(AuthRoutePaths.loginFrom(path));
}
```

`loginFrom` builds `/login?from=<encoded-path>`:

```21:22:packages/feature/account/feature_account_auth/lib/src/routing/auth_route_paths.dart
  static String loginFrom(String from) =>
      '$login?from=${Uri.encodeComponent(from)}';
```

